            <div class="mleg-item"><div class="mleg-dot" style="background:#b45309;box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(176,125,16,0.6);"></div>Yellow — 1 day late / overdue review</div>
            <div class="mleg-item"><div class="mleg-dot" style="background:var(--red);box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(192,24,42,0.6);"></div>Red — 2+ days late / severely overdue</div>
